{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1390,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b34df1ed486264d50cb18796",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在雪地上跑的时候要注意点！\n非常的滑…那里已经\n滑溜溜地咻的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11fd85606617e161c3980261f80e05698bf39779b1c1c2f823b9791fa3589996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cec312800d2ef4e40177be4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天从早上开始就超开心！\r\n想必会迎来非常快乐的一天～！\r\n……耶嘿，希望能成真！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21900dbd3db3fa4f9963cb3ec5a6bf50cf0b4e94eabb6dfad0c9d5e4fe3f1309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cba4036694e62d34d5ed74d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早上练跑时遇到了理事长！\r\n她还让我摸她的猫咪，毛茸茸的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9c1b5e20c33b6e6bfbdbb9c2d13f82bcc2f478dbbec71c5367b9b920912209c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a2811ecdd0583f2b38cef64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时玩了躲避球！\r\n我应该变得更会接球了吧？\r\n还在场上留到最后哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "447ae47576128ff040473cccdb121043f314eae5eb802d2c3b7b42be280739ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d77b82c0ded7e89c1b6522dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的点心\r\n是粉丝送我的苹果！\r\n切成兔子形状再吃吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60b9cf2cbeedafe61c2d83da55c9c815e11bcd2291b11666c804cd77c5428721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50677957172dcb3d321fbe5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "傍晚逛商店街的时候啊，\r\n有人对我说「加油～！」呢！\r\n耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0adb982bf96b3cbf87c9dd866c0fb199f88c04bf40da47fd27ad56b55b8fb7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ee90c57c4eceeb50e1e98c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪避！接住！然后传球！\r\n闪避！接住！然后传球！\r\n很好，今天复习完毕～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb60236057de482969d843d5cb032dc8c645b58e5ea6d66a951b6d56da960541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da7ee392de547718c3d1065",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢春季粉丝大感谢祭，\r\n因为可以和大家一起喊\r\n加油、加油、姆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "892ed5bab35174f6d576f80a95498ef394796db5ef9b8da8002710756a6c3ca1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2475a1f5ae3285501c7386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连肚脐都露出来了，好凉快啊～！\r\n可不可以用来代替运动服……\r\n果然不行啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d93c494b6b2d68da3a72bd039aa3f2539da3190336fcb03b6d47b0c171a252c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0dff92343fecef035e26d9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天有太多美味的食物，\r\n让诗歌剧我很烦恼。\r\n得注意不能让小腹凸出来才行～",
      "source_fingerprint": "76ba57984655ff76c4d162fa8eccee9a31b6e9cafc4841f42051b4b97c716349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6deebb02504b02df68fe703",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对自己的超强意志力很有自信……\r\n有自信……噫呀呀，好冷啊──！\r\n我可能要放弃啦～～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcaecb2a7926d17b12d8a83f25f8a46e03a8b3f3901e3fc8305f6e5d4f1ca8be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a60d074b9a07b66bef0dddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507fc84bfb4e815ab9546f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cd3dee8f70491cc4c2591b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家父母开了一家餐厅，\n味道很棒备受好评哦！\n有机会一定要来试试哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee23ff9600e1e9101c782890b005021add4d59eac317c7cf957143d20a07a3cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91c6f6bbb8db8e01c9a91b04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天，想喝水的时候，\n水洒到地上了…滑倒后\n流鼻血了…呜呜，好疼～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c8456402b7702933318a710ab42f2c15e459947d320216bf48997724a6c7ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d96378ddbf3499be58278a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然很喜欢蜘蛛的玩偶，\n但真正的就…\n总，总有一天会习惯的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70ddadfb0dc1c8a3a01287eab84b90843659aa20eed805f9dae10e7c55c592cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7624eb36853d0a38fe927912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和内恰一起走在商店街的话，\n就会被各种各样的人打招呼哦～。\n嗯呼呼，好有人气啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d8e27325fbcdb6163d73824663b9e901a602058ef2ffcc863685d8a3514cd23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e10eb8ca6627a51782343f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "福来前辈每天早上\n都会帮我占卜运势，\n基本上都是大吉！嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f77edc3aee2ae784f98ef56b300a24057ae308b6bbdeb78c1ae4538b38573ec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b7c3fcbe5a276fc608bb4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hirahira的～\n虽然非常可爱，\n但要注意不让肚子受凉才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9c17b4d6167ec1174707aaaae6d6f331f4a9d01533d4aececa06f82cf7d1937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9bc99c4c7d5a0590dbd70c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是很适合演出的服装吧～\n大家一起站在舞台上的话，\n闪亮亮的～轻飘飘的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d5b571aded7ca654f932a9261266be878e186c08f71c01389e26edadedf0587",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5818c2e52b96bfa2bfbfa49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是！我自己的决胜服！\n也大受父母的好评哦。\n耶～，怎样样～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64370a49599c12fb3e1eff5ec68a251ce9ac7bf38045521223914512f8cfbe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c3135504dd398eb7cc896b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是非～常特别的服装！\n所以要尽情地奔跑\n让大家记住我哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "298fb201238b00f0edf177d63b0438c1d4b0b7702e447583d3e80748d3b8a112",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93fe96dae67aa7d22e3aff9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诗歌剧体操第一部分～！\n抬起脚，嗒嗒嗒ー嗒。\n伸出手，Hohoho～hoy♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7fc756439cbebd2408debeaecccca0d0c611e2230ef77824942288348dfa2df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4f08401275c2a085f88579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要调查一下\n大家午饭都吃了什么！\n都摄取了什么营养呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e147c92d435252c89625ec663ece8a11a84d19c1521fe81091d75b5ec14eaca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4b47b60fbfa82f356d23790",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天深夜，飘来了\n拉面的香味…咕呜。\n不要诱惑我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a1f1f3a21d1bb1a408843b2db998544572425e5e507cd6ecfae3a96162a3b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1f23670d8ed3a415fc78784",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是，会让心情变得暖洋洋～\n的季节呢～。暖烘烘的…\n哈啊…暖洋洋…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dad78ab379714d618cfb22fe0cfb193d96e0d73067d9f1aeabaa3ab18bbdec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93bf2852573b4caf3003519f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没籽的西瓜和有籽的西瓜，\n你喜欢哪个？我绝对是\n有籽的一方！因为摘西瓜籽很快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68a0021f778c19d65e5ebb8be6df84a25376fac2e8759c9eca0bfa0d96e56a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1933c142e3a42729db6b7162",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家的定食店，秋天的秋刀鱼\n套餐很受欢迎！在萝卜泥\n上浇酱油…真不错啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d87d1594b815874588b93d8971f3b60ffcb647cf12e56a668a55bf8f12e152a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91426df3389a3a8651ea978e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，好冷。为了不感冒\n加油吧！准ー备，\n诶，诶…阿嚏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7efb471d306923a6313750a5c9f0e2148c8639132a8f42cf6623f4aab90f628a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d6316c0b45e2c6ae965d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "左边腰上的这个是\r\n小福前辈送我的必胜护身符！\r\n呼哪嘎～哈哪嘎～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a50ab08554f10840882d8f70e440a16e8edb65815ee3aadb11f7661f5e164e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6a22755b0efcc86d1ea8560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我唯一有自信的就是意志力，\r\n但要与桂冠比耐力就……\r\n姆～有办法赢吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9783bc78fc9325aff2af0b4fbfe263a28d946ae415e043a6abbab0d15c362110",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbefe244f0d2ab7e22269407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和生野旅行很棒哦！\r\n她会帮我们做超级、超级完美的\r\n「旅行手册」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84a5e4ce0dbecba576522bb4a7245b6423ab8b6ab33f4e0a79ab3bf5b89415db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34bb58c118de49c1b548d9f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "波旁对我说\r\n「你的用字遣词很不可思议呢」。\r\n……有吗？姆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af03d4b2af3e3953911ba1f0c7eea3d5ff1fe1242dca108171961dce8ef7eee8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd96f7228c60bde06bc2c29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我很普通，所以也会希望自己\r\n能够普通地确实响应大家的声援。\r\n耶嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdcea5b4ffe066b6437491cec51fbecf69f44ac8aa729bfa9af82b15a024845",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fef34f183494f2db961850cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要我绑上一字巾，并戴上手套后，\r\n就算是一大早，也有种干劲的开关\r\n被打开的感觉呢！喝啊喝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9203e2c55076f7e6dbd14b7391750f33bd83b9a9cc5131d1fec1c8f554931cfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb6b48f35a9ebb90ef125dd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要和素质一起吃午餐餐。\r\n……穿着这身衣服去，\r\n不晓得她会不会吓一跳呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ffcd64ec94980c896a66a9679b096aae3ed087e2a537c772e73833330390ef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63dc16624c250f059fc9bd1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上有一点冷呢～\r\n训练员，我可以跟你借一件\r\n披肩之类的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d74d347dfb748ffd78b1ce476cae86255080688247be4cd4e691f6eb05df2a58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c630e161814e818b90d8d247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，你看我的指甲油，是不是\r\n很像蒲公英？有黄色又有黄绿色！\r\n学园外面也都开花了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "11c8bda30abd0832f975ca19d2bdd8839201c982bf1969c9b6dae670d53fc837",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:463b338efa55675ffa0dee94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得现在的我跟夏天很搭吗？\r\n因为你看！在碧海蓝天下，\r\n有蓝色的诗歌剧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e004d7a19f2f11f60fe66b6d3c5312105c67cba43eafa5e01e1e5d0d95584528",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ff07ee1e0dc87c152b1769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要去町内会办的秋季祭典？\r\n我有一件机密消息，听说……\r\n那里的团子好像可以吃到饱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "504caaac57ecffd0a5b0483c5aa065caf48c3ba27050eb580f1d5490a138249a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:843efe31afea9f93c993c170",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然肚子和手臂有一点冷，\r\n不过脚的部分还挺温暖的哦！\r\n因为你看，毛茸茸的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdb7d9168af94c33140eb1f368d89bed23a71434ae60215c6d446549ec16db1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ee0f2416fdf0c3dd71ed5a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵！\r\n你知道这个MT代表什么意思吗～？\r\n没错！就是诗歌剧（MachiTan）～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeb563bb3a19dd24f05596494840a6ba74ffff5ace9d7610e77331e9dac0d8ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdd5e8f74e0756e974fb8b05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，请看。\r\n我的头发和尾巴都很柔顺。\r\n柔顺、柔顺、柔顺顺～",
      "source_fingerprint": "356eae1793da323315c108313430a9661aca6cb362f394f336d0599b9a564566",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d23c3d5ba0936eef004d92e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备工作充分做好了哦～！\n快快，开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a07ee117d9211053f2c8f339d7c129da0fb2e8c36d85e5005d0356eb21d59b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb63c14e3a7b810f73079c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c61cd020f36a57f9e858b761603be4758421e3441eed0dabeb722fec8d21bb41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da86740649d950da5f264a41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "注意到的事要好好记下来！\n什么时候开始都可以哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9055535efc1050d6ba6801e34b61b3ee3231fac115504f4af538a4d470ae261d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1139feea38a4e9bf390a9e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练，训练♪\n今天的训练是什么呢，\n哟嘿咻♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe549d9a55842720d76ef5a6cdfc65c8c277e0a572f50c1ac01de4f29583aaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de48abf217cea38fd8d6243",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你看看我超乎寻常\n的奔跑吧！\n嘻嘻，开～玩笑的～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee1e1b19cbd649f6b020be4cee431551aee05a4aecab79206c396d5332eb7f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0e68f1975104487976e7957",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么都可以告诉我哦！\n训练员说的话一定\n是对的！所以。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36820704b21856a38ae9885c2d865e33374e5e6ffd0639db06d5a1befa6af32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:545b31ada5c2c63a47f91804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练计划\n请告诉我。每天都很期待\n看到那个哦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "406eaaa47fd146214bc2473561a2291519f04e36dc57d98d4f8a43a1468dccaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3fead8cfd5fb439e4549792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员在旁边的话，\n就能比平常加倍加倍\n加倍加ー倍地努力！呣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b60153100fd11272e3e502d42c3a48e82dc148532a2ab3e658f0c28e8a85c8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b3851091f0957b27851c459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吼吼ー！集训，集训！\n在训练开始之前，\n想光着脚在沙滩上跑啊～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dd4d4032363146dd37f630765d0437f2fa0fbab47dc4b6a04493db2a6e88090",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9dea8324814f8f35807d975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有必胜护身符！\r\n迈向胜利～预备～开始──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de906de86443679f9018216423c2e8e132bfeb86c799ba945b248522c84910cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b486b27557ea7c5de2bae3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一字巾绑好！手套戴好！\r\n今天也要跑步啰～要跑起来啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba170924af3c71f315c9f09e837d91e90feab8860b8bde202a38fa727a01d91a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c08231cc1f1bc49128ebd1a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力的──！\r\n毕竟就算是我，\r\n也会有为我声援的人在呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65e058a01804448570f49cfe50b0f41d4f21377222b60d4e8f2f9535cee60c35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab062bc9e17b242aacb62bb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别看我这样，我可是很强壮的！\r\n不论是怎样的训练，都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b14fc273fd83902036f354d98dfe50a9d3ece48afd629e3f60d9dfce61df268a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c0afbd2ce8e4babc18bd903",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲全满！真希望今后\r\n我们两个也能够继续展现出\r\n亮眼的表现给大家看呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4e43a8796b1a92023b117e758555277ee32c0a332a2e8720877647e7230ea4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6250a9a395e2d5c032218235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天，要大声地\r\n去向为我们加油的人们道谢哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7b66f3e8d54ebfffb968895fb54a2177545203b4b83edd652620cd403f5daa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef51308c54270080fe2a83f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我认为只要有情谊在，\r\n不论什么难关都能克服！\r\n……耶嘿，说说而已啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ff428aaeb20a227546e3274c8d9ebc9be19845af19fa1fbd31ec736f4673f85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec283a279901f2be97d40ad6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是与训练员一起的特别时间…\n这份喜悦也要平分！嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9974817aede428312cf6d2cc5de05ec8b55395205699aab790a74340c7e27eae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22d1fd121c17189c4de114ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿…我，充分努力了吧，呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c197953268ae6226605fe991d19525b1847a8aa835095073b273a9fb921cd618",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e290d0614d9cd3fc44e61679",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我与训练员间的情谊之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcee3367a2d92d8fe8e1dbf91a85f70e938b812c4a273087fe33071d3d7007a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1017c4b65cb1bcec2db4c05c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我尽力了！给自己一个花章！姆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc231e2a9e88f248fb14560703933eacd7735ef9d4909ec6251c80d22fb21e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77f1031db0fce0190fafaca9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘻嘻…还能继续前进呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4801ba6afb8923eb17669d03fa2fca3b42ce502833d2698413d5a4d233d568c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3d4b29b77062edaa2b30aa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能就这样结束！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a7c7e45b804b46234fe67dfb2b44d89d52825ab0307a7ecf96a595d097939e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90e85588274c2f2d099c06dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是待兼诗歌剧！请关关照照哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fbe89653ad8a8d24bd8c823f479949fe5b9ea3bfcc20997ec5701ad0a05c413",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e55ea120a943185debe1b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能帮上更多忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1bd672d11a1338b131b8086eb0140ffedb557978309711c0c7715f851ff08b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adde317b41d996bb6d6cf3d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "依赖我也可以哦！嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a454b4323e8a7798044089e3e3e0a713981242815fd721281e26082042ed901c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404bcb1606b95a0498723c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诗歌剧之力，提升！锵锵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa7f2961646acf48495180e1234e3debde7ea61b98f9f50709a92ff6ebc5910b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7597a21ef7bb3d82e2b3902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放心交给我！\r\n看我全～部接住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7192890889f30af7d7567266bd2b61d9dc85b174b2df5af9bcd9902da197813e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38b3de30d1deb60baa1acf72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我接到大家的声援了！\r\n加油、加油、加油～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76674417a98ff8eef85803acb67bdb90072f3bc0e183691f595d9a3e32177317",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e26eaa83bbc364066938d26c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是待兼诗歌剧！总之，\r\n要不要来围成一圈鼓舞士气？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45be6dd30645080706bc11cd56be51543e882d30e4cbc030b84fd0b754c45ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69cd1c3f1ee907a4c34d5c5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時間です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c2c1bcc72a4ae9f88060fcccb1a351bee84241e14492d09ca0748435672cdc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f73dbf1727438b56c6195ab5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつまでも…どこまでも…。\r\n共に走り勝ってゆく。貴方の言葉に\r\nそんな未来が想像できたのです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "546c64388e4aa82adf67cc0d5910312d106d868b366fa6d2c4308128b5ca128f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba9703f39ffdc1ffd2dac24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "それでは。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74c084993ca158e501ad05177ade9fd0503cbb43e1770a8aab310eba4edfad44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f68e158f8d611a6b75f155",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e5bc0c07412060c2d22022d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方は不思議な人です…。理解\r\nしがたいこともある。だからこそ、\r\n傍で貴方を理解してみたいのです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e4ccafdbe9ba4e43fe3fc5109881324518244c6483f5793095dae616ce2f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f417d1b25ccb983d4b9288d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏のそよ風とコーヒーの香り…。\r\n時々、思い出します。またいつか、\r\n遠くへ漕ぎ出したいですね。…共に",
      "source_fingerprint": "996dedae0c96471160b4dfb26d565bb53c3532852919e76e1779334df66384f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f117c7ae5ee8b158ea537d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本年もよろしくお願い申し上げます\r\nでは、福笑いに凧揚げ羽根つき…\r\n正月行事をとことん満喫しましょう",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9db97f25b721c4637d91cb980fc1443e3645de01d114da58005c61d28b97ba4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a2566ff69d13aa2301432e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“友チョコ”を用意する数が\r\n想定よりも増えていました…。\r\nこれは、実に嬉しい想定外です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6e68852997b24de4d504899a6559f1e95bf5cc5a741ec14ae89952d7250b26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1063",
        "10004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
